    "Victoria's Secret held 3.14 million people on its own YouTube channel at once on Sunday and lifted the event's total peak 32.9 percent on last year, having first run a reality series on the same channel and consolidated the broadcast from several platforms onto one — so fund the serialised content in the weeks before your next tentpole and pick a single platform for the stream.",
